      "cmf": {
        "material": "rABS",
        "finish": "smooth_matte",
        "color": "Graphite matte black (Pantone 419 C equivalent), soft-touch velvet hand, \u0394E \u2264 1.5 batch-to-batch",
        "secondary_ops": [
          "soft_touch",
          "pad_print",
          "laser_etch"
        ]
      },
      "intent_anchors": [
        {
          "anchor_id": "IA1",
          "statement": "Keep the single continuous 2.5 mm x 45\u00b0 perimeter chamfer band unbroken on all four edges; do not add parting-line beads, raised bezels or local bosses that interrupt it.",
          "category": "form",
          "must_preserve": true
        },
        {
          "anchor_id": "IA2",
          "statement": "Display window stays flush with the front plane (0.3 mm inset max) and centred at 50% width, 40% height; no raised cover lens or front bezel frame.",
          "category": "form",
          "must_preserve": true
        },
        {
          "anchor_id": "IA3",
          "statement": "Air path is top-in / bottom-out through a gasketed ePTFE membrane vent; preserve \u226515% open intake area at the top slot array and the 1.2 mm recess so IP67 is met without visible mesh on the front face.",
          "category": "durability",
          "must_preserve": true
        },
        {
          "anchor_id": "IA4",
          "statement": "Maintain uniform 1.5 mm nominal wall with local ribbing; do not thicken walls to chase stiffness, as mass must stay under 180 g and sink marks would break the soft-touch finish.",
          "category": "cost",
          "must_preserve": true
        },
        {
          "anchor_id": "IA5",
          "statement": "Single rABS grade, 100% recycled, one soft-touch matte paint system applied to all external surfaces; no secondary material substitutions that would break recyclability or paint adhesion.",
          "category": "sustainability",
          "must_preserve": true
        },
        {
          "anchor_id": "IA6",
          "statement": "USB-C port sits in the bottom chamfer cut-out, sealed by the same perimeter gasket architecture; do not relocate to the front face.",
          "category": "usability",
          "must_preserve": true
        }
      ],
      "rationale": "Chamfered-slab with a continuous chamfer band is the cheapest way to make rABS read as premium: one large simple moulding, no slides on the main body, no cosmetic parting-line work, which protects the CNY 18 ceiling at 10k units/year. Going to a 25.5 mm height accepts the relaxed envelope so the PCB+battery stack and the IP67 perimeter gasket plus ePTFE vent fit without heroic sealing geometry, while the slim silhouette is preserved by keeping length/width at 125 x 75 and the front face visually flat. Flush display and recessed top intake keep the monolith gesture intact and avoid a dirt-trapping bezel outdoors. Uniform 1.5 mm walls plus ribbing hold mass under 180 g and prevent sink marks that would show through the soft-touch matte paint. The single rABS grade with one matte soft-touch paint system keeps the finish, recyclability and cost stories aligned; pad-print and laser-etch carry any branding without added parts."
    },
